  "transcriber_notes": [
   "Rows: 5 year rows + 6 支廳 rows = 11 as printed. 同 expanded. 犯罪 = offences, 檢擧 = arrests/cases cleared as printed. Column order follows the printed order: 總數; 刑法犯 (總數, then offences left-to-right through the first band and then the second band: 信用及ヒ業務ニ對スル罪 .. 毀棄及ヒ隱匿ノ罪); 特別法犯 (總數, then 銃砲.. 暴力行爲等). The sub-heading words 刑法犯 / 特別法犯 are printed as letter-spaced '刑' '犯' / '特' '別' '法' '犯' across the two bands.",
   "Printed '—' is kept wherever a dash is printed; every cell of the 11 rows x 108 data columns was read.",
   "Row checks (犯罪 and 檢擧 separately): 刑法犯 總數 = sum of its 32 offence columns; 特別法犯 總數 = sum of its 19 offence columns; 總數 = 刑法犯 + 特別法犯: 昭和 9 犯罪: 刑法犯 總數 1252 != sum of items 1251; 昭和 9 檢擧: 刑法犯 總數 1190 != sum of items 1189; 昭和 10 犯罪: 刑法犯 總數 1407 != sum of items 1408; 昭和 10 檢擧: 刑法犯 總數 1336 != sum of items 1337 — these four do NOT reconcile (diff 1 each; 昭和 9 items sum 1 below the printed 刑法犯 總數, 昭和 10 items sum 1 above); all items of those two rows re-read, kept as printed. 總數 = 刑法犯 + 特別法犯 holds in every row, and 特別法犯 總數 = sum of items holds in every row."
  ],
